    "local_compute": "vllm:prompt_tokens_by_source{source=local_compute} comes from PrefillStats.num_computed_tokens, set for the first scheduled prefill while request.num_preemptions<=0. It excludes post-preemption repeat prefills.",
    "prefix_cache_queries": "KVCacheManager records a new request cache lookup at admission. PrefixCacheStats puts previously preempted lookups in separate preempted_queries/preempted_hits fields; the inspected Prometheus logger exposes queries/hits for new requests.",
    "emission_time": "PrefillStats is consumed on the first emitted engine output. New-admission queries/hits and first-output prompt/source counters therefore have different phase boundaries. Their differences are not estimates of repeated compute.",
    "physical_scope": "Selecting one endpoint prevents duplicate engine streams. This does not make the prompt counter an accounting of all physical prefill work.",
    "interpretation": "Comparisons support lower reported first-prefill work and changed reuse/capacity pressure. Total repeated prefill work and its critical-path cost remain unmeasured by these counters."
  },
